# Process metrics

When `process_metrics.enabled: true` (see `project.config.yaml`):

## After relevant agent turns

Use skill **process-metrics** to append a **round** to `docs/meta/process-timeline.yaml` unless user said "não registrar métricas".

## Transparency (mandatory)

After each write, reply in **3 lines**:

1. Recorded: round/milestone id, activity, phase, card (if any)
2. Times: human / AI (est.) / idle-before (approx)
3. Panel: run `make hub-build` → `make hub-serve` → `#process` em `docs/meta/project-hub/`

## Context

Resolve phase/activity via `active_context` → single `in_progress` card → skill → gate. If ambiguous: ask once OR `needs_review: true`.

## Human correction

User may edit YAML or ask to fix a round — never hide prior entries; update and rebuild JSON.

## Not a delivery gate

Missing metrics must **not** block cards, specs, or code.

